Age of capture: at the captured state logit x grows at zeta(G-1) per unit time, so after capture has lasted A,
   x0 ~ 1-exp(-zeta(G-1)A): with zeta=1, G=2, A=10 -> 1-4.5e-5; A=30 -> 1-9e-14. The dwell grows ~linearly with the age of capture
   unless something (mutation, immigration, a recruiting alternative lineage) bounds the alternative's share from below.
